<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V ZIMBABWE SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V ZIMBABWE SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day of</p>
<p>the second cricket test between Sri Lanka and Zimbabwe on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings 141 (G.Flower 52; J.Silva 4-16,</p>
<p>M.Muralitharan 4-40)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings (overnight 86-3)</p>
<p> R.Mahanama c A.Flower b B.Strang		 3</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya c A.Whittall b P.Strang	  41</p>
<p> A.Gurusinha c Wishart b B.Strang		88</p>
<p> A. de Silva c and b P.Strang		    16</p>
<p> A.Ranatunga c Wishart b B.Strang		 6</p>
<p> H.Tillekeratne not out			   100</p>
<p> R.Kaluwitharana c A.Flower b G.Whittall     27</p>
<p> C.Vaas st A.Flower b P.Strang		    8</p>
<p> R.Pushpakumara not out			    17</p>
<p> Extras (lb-4 w-3 nb-4)			    11</p>
<p> Total (for 7 wickets, 114 overs)	     317</p>
<p>To bat: M.Muralitharan, J.Silva.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-19 2-58 3-86 4-102 5-216 6-267 7-276.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Olonga 23-4-77-0, B.Strang 20-6-63-3,</p>
<p>A.Whittall 27-6-70-0, P.Strang 28-7-58-3, G.Whittall 14-4-32-1,</p>
<p>G.Flower 2-0-13-0.</p>
